---
source: tests/edit_tests/adr.rs
expression: value
---
$ govctl adr new Original Title
Created ADR: gov/adr/ADR-XXXX-original-title.toml
exit: 0

$ govctl adr edit ADR-0001 title --set New Title
Set ADR-0001.title = New Title
exit: 0

$ govctl adr list
[
  {
    "id": "ADR-0001",
    "status": "proposed",
    "date": "<DATE>",
    "title": "New Title"
  }
]
exit: 0
